window.products.push({"id":888026,"name":"Snips Salva Reggiseno Bra Saver with Hearts Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LgnpIx0PL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Snips brand bra saver allows you to wash your bras without causing damage. The Bra Saver protects them from tangling and snagging in the wash and keeps your bras shapely, comfortable, and supportive. No more hand washing! Made of BPA free material that is resistant to high temperatures. Made in Italy. Snips is a company based south of Milan. The company got its name from its namesake scissors line. Since its inception, Snips has aimed to \"incorporate innovative Italian design into consumer driven household products. \" Every product is also Italian made and manufactured. Snips anticipates consumer's needs, offering problem-solving products with a touch of irony, freshness and originality in the design. They create value with items that are innovative, safe, high quality and with high content. Snips policy of constant innovation led to the adoption of Injection Mold Labeling technology which enables precise application of a photographic decoration, giving a product a captivating appearance and allowing instant recognition of the function the object is used for. Snips s 100% \"Italianness, \" and is the commitment of two generations of the family Piacenza.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LgnpIx0PL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Snips","source_asin":"B003LQ21V6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003LQ21V6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003LQ21V6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
