window.products.push({"id":888208,"name":"Rival Vacuum Sealer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41d156r+07L._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com This vacuum sealer from Rival lets you preserve your leftovers, bulk foods, and important documents far more effectively than using zipper-lock bags or plastic wrap. Oxygen and moisture are the mortal enemies of fresh food and other items. This device vacuums oxygen out of the included pre-cut plastic storage bags, then seals the plastic with its bag cutter. Save time, save money, and preserve the taste and nutritional value of the foods you purchase. Preserve your leftovers, bulk foods, and important documents far more effectively than using zipper-lock bags or plastic wrap. Click here for a larger image Air Out. Freshness In. Why Vacuum Seal? If you're looking to preserve food, vacuum sealing takes air out of the equation. Air can cause oxidation, robbing food of its fresh taste. It can cause dehydration, which hardens foods and promotes freezer burn. It can also expedite mold and bacteria growth. A secure vacuum seal protects your food against all of this, keeping it nice and fresh. The Seal-a-Meal system keeps food fresh for up to five times longer than conventional storage methods. Vacuum trough catches overflow liquids, and is dishwasher safe. How Long Will Food Stay Fresh? The Seal-a-Meal system keeps food fresh for up to five times longer than conventional storage methods. Here are a few examples: In the Freezer: it's always difficult to keep meat, especially fish, fresh. Seal-a-Meal keeps fatty fish like salmon and sea trout fresh for up to one year. In the Freezer: it's always difficult to keep meat, especially fish, fresh. Seal-a-Meal keeps fatty fish like salmon and sea trout fresh for up to one year. In the Refrigerator: anyone who's ever stored berries knows how quickly they turn. The Seal-a-Meal System keeps berries at their best for 1-2 weeks. In the Refrigerator: anyone who's ever stored berries knows how quickly they turn. The Seal-a-Meal System keeps berries at their best for 1-2 weeks. In the Pantry: your favorite cookie recipe makes three dozen--too many to eat before they go stale. The Seal-a-Meal System keeps homemade cookies oven-fresh for 3-6 weeks. In the Pantry: your favorite cookie recipe makes three dozen--too many to eat before they go stale. The Seal-a-Meal System keeps homemade cookies oven-fresh for 3-6 weeks. How Does It Work? The sealer couldn't be easier to use, with its easy press/hold & release system. Grab a back, place your food inside, and it's vacuum sealed with the touch of a button--the sealing strip provides and airtight seal. An indicator light lets you know when it's ready, and you can cancel the process at any time, if necessary. When you're done, cleanup is also a breeze. The sealer features a vacuum trough to catch overflow liquids, and has a dishwasher safe drip tray treated with antimicrobial protection. A bag kit is also included to get you started, and the sealer works with Seal-a-Meal and FoodSaver heat seal bags and rolls. With a Rival Vacuum Food Sealer you can: Keep leftovers as fresh and delicious as the day they were prepared. Keep leftovers as fresh and delicious as the day they were prepared. Prepare make-ahead meals over the weekend, then store them for easy weeknight reheating. Prepare make-ahead meals over the weekend, then store them for easy weeknight reheating. Buy food in bulk then freeze for later--use in meal or serving-size portions. Buy food in bulk then freeze for later--use in meal or serving-size portions. Marinate meats in minutes instead of hours. Marinate meats in minutes instead of hours. Store delicate or moist foods with convenient canisters (not included). Store delicate or moist foods with convenient canisters (not included). Seal and store meals in serving-sized portions for simple and effective portion control. Seal and store meals in serving-sized portions for simple and effective portion control. Seal treasured photographs, collectible books, birth certificates or other valuable items. Seal treasured photographs, collectible books, birth certificates or other valuable items. Technical Specs Weight: 4.40 lbs. Weight: 4.40 lbs. Dimensions: 15 x 7 x 4 inches (L x W x H) Dimensions: 15 x 7 x 4 inches (L x W x H) Cord Length: 24 inches Cord Length: 24 inches What's in the Box Rival FSFGSL0100-015 Vacuum Sealer, Four Seal-A-Meal Vacuum Food Storage Bags, Documentation","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41d156r+07L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rival","source_asin":"B004JPU6XI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004JPU6XI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004JPU6XI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
