window.products.push({"id":888234,"name":"10lb Weighted Blanket + FREE Removable Minky Cover + FULL ZIPPER SYSTEM, Cozy & Cool Weighted Blanket For Adults & Kids, Our Heavy Twin Blanket Made O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ehw1yFTyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our PATENT PENDING Blanket Is Designed By A Team Of American Engineers. Our Passion Is To Introduce New And Improved Every-Day Items To Enhance Consumer Experience.After Lots Of R&D & Countless Prototypes, We‘ve Come Up With The Finest Weighted Blanket On The Market. Our Innovative Design Is The First Of Its Kind. But Since We Are Rather Humble Engineers & Do Not Like To Toot Our Own Horn (Except For The Toot Horning Ritual We Hold Every Day - Just Kidding!!🎺), Here Are Just A Few Reasons Why We Believe Our Weighted Blanket Is Literally THE BEST:✅PATENT PENDING ZIPPER SYSTEM: The One & Only Weighted Blanket On The Market That Uses A Full Zipper System To Easily Attach/Detach The Weighted Blanket From Its Cover. ✅OUR POCKET/QUILT SIZE: Our Weighted Blanket Comes With 3” Square Pockets Compared To ~7” Pockets In Others. That Means Our 10lb, 40x75 Blanket Has A Whopping ~270 Pockets Which Allows For Exceptional Weight Distribution Compared To Only ~70 Pockets in Others (But Who’s Counting 😉)✅COVER: We Know Washing A Dirty Weighted Blanket Is Not For The Faint Of Heart. But Some Companies Still Sell Their Weighted Blankets Without A Cover. So, To Keep Your Blanket Clean, You Would Almost Always End Up Purchasing A Cover Later On. It Is Then That Certain Fundamental Questions Would Come Up. Questions Like: Would The Cover Fit? Would The Ties & Loops In Blanket & Cover Correspond? Why Is Earth Round ❓. So To Make It Easier On You, We Are Offering Our Weighted Blanket With A FREE Custom Made Silky Soft Minky Duvet Cover That Can Easily Be Detached & Machine Washed. Our Minky Cover Is Super Cozy & Cuddly (& If You Do Not Like Cozy, Congratulations! You Are Officially Declared A Unicorn 🦄). All Joking Aside, We Just Wanted You To Have The Best Of The Best.Hope You Enjoy Your Weighted Blanket For Years To Come.XOXOFrom Your Serenity Engineered Weighted Blanket Family","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ehw1yFTyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Serenity Engineered","source_asin":"B07JHG8QLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JHG8QLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JHG8QLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
