window.products.push({"id":888236,"name":"Hooker Furniture Finley Recliner, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qeuROowIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Developed by one of America's premier Manufacturers to offer quality furniture at affordable prices. Each piece is meticulously hand-crafted using the most exquisite leathers in the world. The Sedona Vortex G/s recliner chair is crafted using Sedona Vortex G/s (wipe on) (dark Brown) leather.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qeuROowIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hooker Furniture","source_asin":"B00BGO4TQ0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BGO4TQ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BGO4TQ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":888237,"name":"California White Sage 4\" Smudge Stick, Perfect for Smudging, Meditation, Protection and Incense, 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OLU6TZaxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smudging is an excellent way to restore balance and clear negative energy in your life. There are no limits to when you should smudge, but there are times when it can be incredibly powerful. These include: Settling into a new space: Whenever you move into a new home, office or studio, it’s likely that the energy and balance of the space will be a complete mess and this can reflect negatively on you directly. Cleansing the area will ensure that you have fresh start and allows you to instill your personal energy flow and positive vibes from the very start. Recovering after a traumatic event: Losing a job, getting laid off, having a love one pass away or falling ill can be devastating and often takes long periods and extensive energy to recover from. Smudging helps smoothen out and expedite the process of returning to a normal state of health, mind, and strength. Following a change in your life: Landing a new job, opening a business, or reaching a big milestone is also an excellent time to cleanse your environment and prepare your space for the new energy that’s going to be coming your way. By smudging during these exciting times, you’ll be able to clear your mind, focus your energy and set yourself up for continued success while building even more momentum! There’s no reason to make cleansing complicated. You only need the basic tools and the right mindset.Basic smudging technique consists of: Preparing your materials Cleansing yourself (Mind and body) Smudging your space Concluding ritual (returning sage ashes to earth, cleaning your tools, etc.) More information is included in the Beverly Oaks Smudging Guide that comes with our kit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OLU6TZaxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beverly Oaks","source_asin":"B076VWGKRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076VWGKRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076VWGKRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
