window.products.push({"id":888287,"name":"Household Essentials Vintage Wood Suitcase Storage Trunk, Small, White/Newspaper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VIMjT3ZAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Household Essentials Small Vintage Newspaper Suitcase Trunk reinvigorates a classic of home storage: the suitcase! This small storage box trunk is 8.625 Inch high x 19.75 Inch wide x 11.5 Inch deep. It's a sturdy wooden storage trunk, but it has been remade to look like a vintage suitcase: flat bottom, domed lid, clasp closures. But the true touch is the overlay of vintage newsprint! Newsprint with vintage ads covers the lid and interior of the suitcases. It's the best of nostalgia in a modern world. Perfect for common room storage, this Vintage Newspaper Suitcase storage trunk is a conversation starter—the kind of décor that is always a find.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VIMjT3ZAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B01KK7KJVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KK7KJVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KK7KJVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
