window.products.push({"id":888293,"name":"Useful. It's Stainless Steel Bathtub Caddy with Extending Sides and Book Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nKEXPLf4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Convenient. Clever. Cozy. Those aren't words you often hear together, but they all apply perfectly to the Useful. UH-BC187 Bathtub Caddy. That's because this cleverly designed piece of hardware can conveniently accommodate all the many sundries that make your bath a cozy pleasure. Want to keep a book or magazine at the ready even when your hands are wet? The book holding tray and adjustable backrest have got you covered. Need a spot to store a dry wash cloth? Easy, drape it anywhere over the unit. Need to keep a bar of soap or shampoo bottle at the ready? There are two trays that are ideal for that. And if you need more room for your hygiene products, or even for a snack or beverage, the book holder is fully removable. And you can count on the stainless steel Useful. UH-BC187 to last for years even if it sees daily use. Its polished exterior resists rust and corrosion, and it is sturdy and resilient, resisting bending and/or breaking even under a decent amount of weight or if it is accidentally bumped or knocked out of place. The arms of the caddy can be extended as needed depending on the width of the bathtub, and the unit features a vinyl coating over the ends of both arms that protects the surface of your tub from scratches and/or marks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nKEXPLf4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J Miles Co.","source_asin":"B014DY16U6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014DY16U6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014DY16U6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
