window.products.push({"id":888306,"name":"Cross Strap Shelf Stabilizer Kit – Heavy-Duty Shelf Hardware Kit w/ 72” Stabilizer Wires, L Brackets for Shelves, Banjo & Head Screws – Corner Support","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711gQApGrpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Rockler Woodworking Living Room Shelving Furniture Kit: Get your old and unsteady bookshelves or cabinets sturdy and ready to use again with this corner bracket shelf kit. This kit provides a very modern minimalist look. No backs are required to stabilize your bookshelves.The stabilizer kit also works beautifully on any ordinary shelf or cabinet that needs additional support against racking, such as older furniture where the joints have started to loosen up. --Cross Strap Stabilizer Instructions: Position the 4 corner brackets for wood near a fixed top, bottom, or horizontal shelf and attach using two ½” #4 wood head screws for each bracket. Be sure to orient the corner bracket so that the attachment side with two screw holes is on the outside of the panel. Using a 1/8” bit (sold separately), pre-drill the hole for the banjo screw. Install the screws of cabinet angle brackets up to their shoulder using the provided Allen wrench. Thread the cross strap through the hole in the banjo screw and pull until the ball end is captured. Thread the end of the cross strap through the banjo screw located diagonally opposite the captured end. Pull the furniture corner shelves strap to remove the excess slack and turn the screw clockwise to lock in the tension. Snip off the excess wire. --- About Us: The history of Rockler Woodworking and Hardware goes back to 1954 when Norton Rockler started the Minnesota Woodworkers Supply Company in north Minneapolis. It was a small mail-order business with a big aspiration – to become woodworkers' go-to resource for everything they need to complete their projects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711gQApGrpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"I-Semble","source_asin":"B00ARE8OZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ARE8OZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ARE8OZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":888307,"name":"Fox Run Pickle/Olive Picker, Chrome Plated, 0.25 x 0.75 x 6 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.91,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617P3iiXXwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Use our handy Pickle Picker Fork to easily get foods from deep jars. Simply jab the specially designed fork into the food item and easily release by pressing on the plunger. Made of durable iron featuring a sleek electroplated chrome finish and rubber wood top, it's great for grabbing pickles, olives, beets, peppers, and more. The pickle picker is a versatile tool, so it's perfect for keeping out on the table during parties for guests to grab appetizers from plates. Never struggle with a knife or fork again and keep your fingers from getting covered in juice by using this pickle picker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617P3iiXXwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fox Run","source_asin":"B083ZRGRRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083ZRGRRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083ZRGRRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":888308,"name":"Siphoens Air Conditioner Portable For Room - 3 In 1 Design Evaporative Compac Air Cooler Fan With 3 Wind Speeds,Usb Personal Mini Ice Ac Fan With 7 Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wvo51A2BS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Air Conditioner Fan Air Cooler Mini USB Air Conditioner Fan Desktop Cooling Fan *Compact air conditioner* The latest evaporative cooling technology absorbs hot air, then passes it through a wet filter, and then discharges it as cool, fresh air on the other side. *Quick cooling* Quickly cool the surrounding hot air. This air-type personal space regulator draws warm air from through an evaporative water filter to create your personal space with humidified and cool air, allowing you to add essential oils, ice or ice water to the water tank to speed up the cooling rate . *Portable handle* Portable design, small size, you can easily carry, very suitable for home, office, outdoor picnic, etc. In summer, just press the switch to enjoy the wind cooling, it is your best companion for summer life. *Easy to operate and save space* Just add water to the water tank and plug in the power supply, you can enjoy the cool air; portable handle and lightweight design, very convenient to carry, very suitable for home and office use. ★New Water Tank Design Remove the lid and add water and ice, no need to worry about overflow. ★Bladeless Design Adults and children need not worry about safety. ★Adjustable Fan Blade Design Freely adjust the cold wind angle ★Smart Button Design Find your own pattern Specification： √ Power mode: USB √ Rated voltage: DC5V √ Rated power: 6W √ Product Color: White √ Noise: 40db √ Negative ion working power: 1W Package Include： √ 1x Air Conditioner Fan √ 1xCharging Line √ 1xUser's Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wvo51A2BS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Siphoens","source_asin":"B09C1F148S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C1F148S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C1F148S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
