window.products.push({"id":888402,"name":"Andaz Press Sturdy White Personalized Wedding Day Card Box Navy Blue Watercolor Custom Wedding Gift Boxes for Cards Personalized Card Box 10x10x10 Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XIq1qUUwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"10 x 10 x 10-INCH BOX SIZE: Perfect to hold all the wedding cards, this card box is easy to assemble and beautiful to display. This white card box goes perfectly with rustic or any style weddings. Not too large or too small, this 10x10 card box can be placed on your wedding table for guests to leave their wedding gift cards safely inside. CUSTOM PRINT: Personalize this Andaz Press wedding card box with wedding names and dates. The rustic look of this card box can be used in a country wedding. Or for the wedding with bohemian decor, use a white card box to compliment the reception space. Choose from beautiful font designs that are easy to read and customizable with couple's names and the wedding date. WEDDING CARD BOX: Use a beautiful card box to hold all your wedding gift cards from your guests. These Andaz Press custom wedding day card boxes can be used in country-style, rustic, modern, industrial, classic,or bohemian-style weddings. It is the little details of the design that will make your wedding reception memorable. With a rustic wedding card box, guests can drop their gift cards conveniently into these 10\" X 10\" X 10\" white card boxes. EASY ASSEMBLY STURDY CARDSTOCK BOX: The eco-friendly card box ships flat and requires easy assembly. Made from sturdy card stock, this rustic wedding card box can hold gift cards and money. A wedding money card box that can be customized for the occasion is also durable to hold many wedding gift cards. It's foldable feature is perfect to store as a memorable keepsake. CHOOSE YOUR DESIGN: Choose from different designs and customize your wedding card box with couple's name and wedding date. With floral designs and fun fonts, Andaz Press has so many beautifully created designs that will suit your wedding decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XIq1qUUwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andaz Press","source_asin":"B09CTG3X7V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CTG3X7V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CTG3X7V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
