window.products.push({"id":888407,"name":"Cordless Cellular Shades Window Blinds, Sky Blue Custom Bottom Up Honeycomb Shade Window Blinds for Windows","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HReZPDsKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"①DESCRIPTION: Cordless cellular window shades provide a clean look and safe for family with children or pets. Premium honeycomb design, Light Filtering honeycomb shades keep privacy at same time allow the light go through. ②ORDER CONFIRMATION: When picking up the color then go to \"Customize Now\" Page, finish the custom options as our instruction. We will double confirm the order information please reply the e-mail in 24 hours when you placed the order. If we don't get your reply, the shades will be made as the size you ordered. ③INSIDE MOUNT: Custom size 20\"-59\" wide， MAX height is 70.8 inches to fit window. Measure the width and length inside of the window frame. Select the window width and length to make the order. We remove 0.2 Inch when producing the honeycomb shade. Window depth need more than 2 Inches, otherwise please choose outside mount. ④OUTSIDE MOUNT: Measure window outer frame width and length. Add 3-10 Inches on the window width and length to get the shade size. Select exact shade size you want to cover to make the order. We won't take any deduction. ⑤ISSUES COVERED: When you receive the package, if have any problems (the package is damaged/ the accessories are lost/ the product is dirty, etc.), please feel free to contact us. We offer you a solution until to your satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HReZPDsKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUAKY","source_asin":"B0BJPBZD5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJPBZD5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJPBZD5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
