window.products.push({"id":888413,"name":"puredown Down Comforter Full/Queen Size, 75% Down Filling Lightweight Oversized Blanket Ultra-Soft Duvet Insert for Summer Hot Weather/Sleeper Light G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ux4mVCPyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LIGHTWEIGHT DOWN COMFORTER】- Full/Queen Size: 88*88\". This down comforter is super lightweight, prevents overheating, keeps you cool, dry, and warm, helps you wake refreshed. Ideal for Summer Hot Weather/Sleeper. Available in 3 colors, the white color feels brighter and fresher, and the grey color is more modern and also best at hiding stains, can be used as Duvet Insert or Stand-Alone Comforter. 【75% DOWN FILLING】 - This down comforter is filled with sufficient naturally breathable down and feather blend - 75% white down and 25% feather, which is ethically sourced and Responsible Down Standard (RDS), OEKO-Tex Standard 100 certified. Down has better insulation than other types of fillings. It keeps you warm without adding extra weight and bulk, the higher the down percentage, the warmer it will be. 【BREATHABLE FABRIC】- Downproof peach skin microfiber cover, ultra-soft, skin-friendly, allows your body to breathe at night, which makes sleeping a lot more comfortable. Simple but elegant design, fits the various types of decoration, with its Elegant Flowing Drape and Matte Sheen, this comforter adds more beauty, sense of luxury, and coziness to your bedroom. 【PROFESSIONAL DESIGN】- Box-stitched design keeps the filling in place for maximum warmth, without any clumping. Corner tabs help secure the comforter in place, prevent shifting, superior double-needle stitch avoids leakage, makes the comforter more durable, ensures a stable and comfortable sleep. 【CARE INSTRUCTION】- Dry clean only. It is usually unnecessary to clean a down comforter frequently, so as not to make the down filling less effective. The down comforter is packaged in a vacuum bag, it is recommended to spread it for a few hours and pat the comforter gently to fully expand or tumble in the dryer for 10 minutes at low temperature at first-time use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ux4mVCPyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"puredown","source_asin":"B09SCRDPV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SCRDPV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SCRDPV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
