window.products.push({"id":888492,"name":"Household Essentials Wide Fabric Storage Bin with Lid, 18.5\" W x 15\" D, Wide-18.5\", Natural and Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r6Jn4AsoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This sturdy and stylish storage box with lid provides limitless organizational functionality for your dressers, closets, basements, or home storage areas. Its timeless design, natural color, and fashionable brown fabric trim create an aesthetically pleasing alternative for plastic totes or old shoebox makeshift storage solutions designed to hide clutter. The storage container is made of a poly linen and is reinforced with solid siding for added stability, durability, and stackability. The natural canvas blend provides optimal protection from dirt, dust, cobwebs, moths, and other potentially damaging elements in your home, yet offers breathability so your woven items won’t fall victim to stale or stuffy odors over time. Each box features a single decorative handle for easy, one-handed access at all times. These wide storage boxes blend neatly with any home decor and certainly don’t have to be relegated to out-of-sight areas. Ideal in any home storage application, these storage boxes are perfect for bedrooms (sheets, pillows), bathrooms (towels, washcloths, toiletries), attics (collectibles, antiques), home offices (office supplies, craft supplies), or anywhere else clutter tends to collect. When not in use, the box folds flat and can be tucked away easily without taking up valuable excess space. Attractive and functional, this storage box with lid is the perfect solution for your home’s organizational challenges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71r6Jn4AsoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B0C4K567SN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4K567SN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4K567SN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
