window.products.push({"id":888614,"name":"Pyramid America Bob Dylan - Sweet Marie Framed Poster - Print with Protective Textured Coating in 13in x 19in Black Frame & Ready to Hang","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CrvWm29-L._AC_SL1008_.jpg","description":"Decorate your space with this Bob Dylan Framed Poster. A great addition to any room or a thoughtful gift for a fan or collector. Each officially licensed poster has a transparent, acrylic gel textured coating that not only protects the image, but also gives a stunning movie screen-type finish. The 11\" x 17\" poster comes in a 13\" x 19\" black MDF frame with no glass or plexiglass and Two sawtooth hangers on the back for easy installation. Our unique, high quality posters bring the most popular trends from music, sports, video games and entertainment to your walls!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CrvWm29-L._AC_SL1008_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pyramid America","source_asin":"B09SNXLC5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SNXLC5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SNXLC5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":888615,"name":"Rizzo Italian Collection-1800 Premium Series-3-Piece Solid Sheet Set-Sale Brushed Microfiber with Deep Pocket-Fitted,Flat Sheet & Pillow Cases-Twin, O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rxYf+EzYL._AC_SL1171_.jpg","description":"Microfiber is an all-season fabric with its ability to hold color well. Stain Resistant-People with children and those looking for sturdy material for a bedroom, children's room or RV may especially like microfiber fabric for its durability and stain resistance. The material is so tightly woven — with fibers thinner than a human hair that it naturally repels water and stains. Even highly staining substances like coffee can usually be wiped away without a trace if they are caught right away. Get a classy and comfortable finish every time you make up your room. This soft fabric resist wrinkling and fading and item comes in various colors and textures to suit your needs and decorate your homes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rxYf+EzYL._AC_SL1171_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"\"Rizzo Italian Collection\"","source_asin":"B012CUMNIM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012CUMNIM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012CUMNIM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
