window.products.push({"id":888617,"name":"Set of 3 Mini Potted Plants Arrangement Faux Boxwood Eucalyptus Rosemary Plants in Rustic Galvanized Metal Pots with Rectangle Wood Box for Farmhouse ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bYTC6hZtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity: Package includes 1 pcs Rectangle Wood Box, 3 pcs Rustic Galvanized Metal Pots, 1 pcs Artificial Boxwood Leaves Stem, 1 pcs Artificial Eucalyptus Leaves Stem, and 1 pcs Artificial Rosemary Stem. The galvanized metal pots and artificial greenery stems come separately, so you can mix the artificial greenery with flowers yourself to get a custom match to your home decor! A group of three matching pots will create a beautiful farmhouse centerpiece that adds vintage character to your table. Color: This faux greenery arrangement is a composition of boxwood, eucalyptus, and rosemary in vibrant green hues with a lush and full shape. Each galvanized tin features a classic, corrugated metal look and finished with a jute twine for a rustic charm. The farmhouse rectangle wooden box is deep brown. So unique and elegant, use these artificial plants set in galvanized pots as a part of a rustic farmhouse chic style home decor, they are sure to bring your surrounding a refreshing charm. Size: The faux stems are about 7.6\" tall and 7.8\"-9.4\" wide. Each galvanized metal planter is about 3.1\" wide and 4.3\" tall, and each wood planter box is about 11.3\" L x 4.4\" W x 2\" H, perfect for holding the potted plants. The finished faux potted plants are about 9.1\" wide and 9.5\" tall. This artificial greenery arrangement is ideally sized to make a beautiful centerpiece on your table, also perfect for placement on desk, mantel, or shelves. Material: Faux boxwood, eucalyptus and rosemary are made of plastic. Metal pots are made of rustic galvanized tin and have an aged-looking patina for a charming vintage style. The wood box is made of natural wood with a deep brown finish and beautiful wood grains. Arrange in your own way, this artificial plant greenery arrangement will bring an everlasting green and fresh feel to your home without worrying about watering, trimming, or sunlight. This rustic faux greenery arrangement set is versatile enough for you to lay it out based on your personal taste. You can mix the green plants with flowers yourself to create one-of-a-kind farmhouse centerpiece for your dining table, coffee table, rustic wedding dinner party, garden party, baby shower, bridal brunch, and special events. They look great on desk, nightstand, windowsill, mantel, foyer, kitchen island, and shelves. As great gift for housewarming, birthday, Mother's Day, and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bYTC6hZtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B09NXV6CD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NXV6CD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NXV6CD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
