window.products.push({"id":888706,"name":"Hexagram Sunflower Pillow Covers 18x18, Buffalo Plaid Sunflower Decor Summer Pillow Covers for Couch Sofa Indoor Outdoor Yellow Sunflower Bee Pillows ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81htUk9XQLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft Polyester ★★ Summer Pillow Covers 18x18 : yellow sunflower pillow covers, would be plenty full with the 18x18 inch pillows. Made of soft polyester material, comfortable and durable. Beautiful sunflower bee decor pillow covers fit for couch sofa patio bench living room indoor and outdoor home decor. GREAT VALUE FOR YOUR MONEY. ★★ Great Addition for Sunflower Decor : Vivid buffalo plaid and yellow sunflower bee pattern are all clearly printed on this yellow outdoor pillow covers, easily decor home with vibrant colors. Picture just as advertised. Perfectly summer decor pillows, GREAT ADDITION FOR HOLIDAY PARTY DECOR. ★★ Sunflower Pillow Covers 18x18 : 18x18 inch size (45x45 cm), easy to put it on and off, soft and comfortable touch to skin. Hidden zipper designs, looks elegant and get lots of compliments. PERFECT SPRING SUMMER FLORAL DECOR FOR HOME, COUCH, SOFA, LIVING ROOM OUTDOOR PATIO, BENCH etc. ★★ Washable & Colorful, Colors Keep Fresh As New : Washable in the cold water, dry it like other daily things, colors keep freash new, would not fade. NOTE: ONLY SUNFLOWER PILLOW COVERS, PILLOW INSERTS ARE NOT INCLUDED. ★★ Outdoor Pillow Covers 18x18 : Yellow sunflower design and bee kind quotes would be a great summer party decor for home, decor your own living room, couch and sofa, outdoor porch patio bench. Rustic black yellow colors help u creating perfect seasonal atmosphere, and get a lot of compliments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81htUk9XQLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hexagram","source_asin":"B0BZHR1MNG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZHR1MNG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZHR1MNG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":888707,"name":"FoodSaver 8\" x 20' Heat-Seal Roll","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lsuxz0IyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ideal for vacuum-seal sealing cuts of meat, fish, leftovers, pantry items, and more. view larger 8-inch by 20-foot roll of heat-seal bag material for making custom-length bags (for use with FoodSaver vacuum-sealing systems). view larger Creates an air-tight barrier around foods, which helps prevent spoilage and freezer burn. view larger *Based on buying in bulk, buying on sale, and preventing waste. view larger BPA-free material with air-removal channels and multi-layer construction to block moisture and oxygen. view larger FoodSaver 8-Inch Roll Make Custom-Length Bags FoodSaver's 8-inch by 20-foot roll of heat-seal bag material makes it possible to create 8-inch wide bags that are as long as you need. The convenient custom-length storage bags mean no more wasted material or precarious \"doesn't quite fit\" scenarios. Use the custom-length bags for storing anything from cuts of meat, fish, and make-ahead meals in the freezer to leftovers or fresh produce in the fridge to homemade cookies, crackers, and other snacks in the pantry. A white panel on the transparent bag allows for writing the date and contents of the food being stored for easy reference. The versatile bags can even be used for storing non-food items like silverware, jewelry, liquid travel items, or passports and other important documents. Create an Air-Tight Seal Designed for use with any FoodSaver heat-seal vacuum sealing system (not included), the FoodSaver 8-inch roll provides exceptional flexibility. Simply cut a piece to your desired length, seal one end, fill, and then vacuum seal. The vacuum sealing system automatically removes all the air from the bag and then uses heat to create an airtight seal, which locks out moisture and air to protect food and maintain freshness. Multi-Layer BPA-Free Material The FoodSaver 8-inch roll features a unique multi-layer BPA-free material with ThickShield protection and specially designed channels that allow for the complete removal of air. Removing all of the air from inside the bag and creating an air-tight barrier around food locks in freshness and effectively prevents stored items from spoiling or getting freezer burned. In addition to blocking moisture and oxygen that can compromise the freshness of food, the material's multi-layer construction makes the bags safe and strong enough for freezing, microwaving, and simmering. Vacuum seal foods prepared ahead of time, then cook and serve without sacrificing freshness. Keeps Food Fresh up to 5x Longer -- Save up to $2700 a Year As always, the FoodSaver system keeps your food fresh up to five times longer compared to other storage methods (like zipper bags, foil, plastic wrap and containers) and helps you save up to $2700 a year by buying food in bulk, purchasing on-sale food items, and not having to worry about freezer burn or wasted food. About the FoodSaver brand The FoodSaver brand provides a range of vacuum sealing systems and an array of useful accessories like containers, jar sealers, and wine-bottle stoppers as well as pre-cut freezer bags and rolls of bag material for creating custom-size bags. An effective and convenient food-storage solution. The FoodSaver brand not only helps people save time, money, and food, but it also helps keep kitchens running smoothly and efficiently--perfect for busy families or for those who love to entertain. FoodSaver Products vs. Ordinary Storage Methods FREEZER Ordinary Storage FoodSaver System Beef, Game & Poultry 6 months 2-3 years Fish 6 months 2 years Soups & Stews 3-6 months 1-2 years Coffee Beans 6-9 months 2-3 years Vegetables 8 months 2-3 years Bread 6-12 months 1-3 years REFRIGERATOR Ordinary Storage FoodSaver System Cheese 1-2 weeks 4-8 months Lettuce 3-6 days 2 weeks Berries 1-6 days 1-2 weeks PANTRY Ordinary Storage FoodSaver System Flour & Sugar 6 months 1-2 years Rice & Pasta 6 months 1-2 years Cookies 1-2 weeks 3-6 weeks FoodSaver Bags and Rolls Comparison Zipper Bags Heat-Seal Bags & Rolls Portion Pouch Liquid Block Expandable Available size(s) Quart- and Gallon-Size Bags 8\" and 11\" Rolls; Pint-, Quart- and Gallon-Size Bags 11\" Roll Quart-Size Bags 11\" Roll Keeps food fresh up to 5x longer* ✓ ✓ ✓ ✓ Keeps food fresh longer** ✓ Reusable for frequently used foods like deli meat and cheese ✓ Reinforced double zipper ensures an air-tight seal ✓ Prevents freezer burn ✓ ✓ ✓ ✓ BPA Free ✓✓✓✓✓ Perforated center seam for customized food prep and storage ✓ Time-saving solution; seal 2 bags at once ✓ Ideal for creating individualized portions ✓ Liquid block strip traps moisture ✓ Great for moist foods ✓ Ideal for fresh meats and fish ✓ Side pleats for easy storage of large items ✓ Time-saving solution: no need to cut up large pieces of meat or food ✓ Ideal for larger roasts, whole turkeys, casseroles, pies, and more ✓ * than ordinary storage methods ** based on testing of turkey and muenster cheese wrapped in plastic wrap or aluminum foil","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lsuxz0IyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOODSAVER","source_asin":"B0025N2MKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0025N2MKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0025N2MKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":888708,"name":"Libbey Collins Entertaining Set with 4 Tumbler Glasses and Pitcher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AUaPyX-mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you have a big family, you know the challenge of finding a drink everyone likes. Our recommendation? Stick with Tom Collins. It's an easy go-to classic with plenty of spinoffs, from tequila to cognac. Whichever version you decide to serve, this set is just what you need to do so in style. Celebrate This! with Glassware from Libbey If you’ve ever sipped from a glass, odds are you’ve already met Libbey. We rank as the top glassware manufacturer in the Americas and one of the largest tableware suppliers in the world. As the runaway leader, we are setting new standards for stability, strength, and growth opportunity. We believe every occasion — big and small — is an opportunity to celebrate life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AUaPyX-mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Libbey","source_asin":"B0778N4GST","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0778N4GST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0778N4GST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":888709,"name":"Amaze-Heater Plug-In Thermostat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kTybdf+KL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"The Amaze-Heater Plug-In Thermostat provides the convenience of setting any of the Amaze-Heater wall panel convection heaters to maintain the desired room temperature. The thermostat is also a great addition for any type or brand of indoor heater or indoor wall air-conditioner unit. It will allow you to set the desired temperature, conserve energy and save money. The thermostat is an analog dial system for simplicity allowing you to set the desired temperature in Fahrenheit or Celsius. Simply select heat or cool setting on the rear of the unit, set to the desired temperature on the front dial, plug into the wall outlet and then plug in your heating or cooling appliance – it’s that easy! The thermostat even includes an easy on and off switch on the front to turn both the thermostat and the appliance on or off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kTybdf+KL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amaze-Heater","source_asin":"B0815Y17L7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0815Y17L7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0815Y17L7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":888710,"name":"La Pastiche Water Lilies Evening with Athenian Silver Framed Oil Painting, 29 in x 25 in, Multi-Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ffZLzyr6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description 20\" X 24\" Oil Painting On Canvas Need Help Decorating your Home? Click Here to get Inspired! Hand painted oil reproduction of a famous Monet painting, Water Lilies; Evening. Today it has been carefully recreated detail-by-detail, color-by-color to near perfection. Why settle for a print when you can add sophistication to your rooms with a beautiful fine gallery reproduction oil painting? While Monet successfully captured life's reality in many of his works, his aim was to analyze the ever-changing nature of color and light. Known as the classic Impressionist, Monet cannot help but inspire deep admiration for his talent in those who view his work. This work of art has the same emotions and beauty as the original. Why not grace your home with this reproduced masterpiece? It is sure to bring many admirers! Frame Description: New Age Black Frame From the Manufacturer OverstockArt is an art manufacturer of framed hand painted oil reproductions and canvas art prints. overstockArt was among the earliest online galleries of hand painted oil paintings and the first to focus on art reproductions of great masters such as Van Gogh, Monet and Klimt. From Impressionist art to Modern Art, overstockArt has the perfect framed canvas art for your home. At overstockArt, we live and breathe the oil paintings that surround us and feel we have a special connection with our customers. Put simply, we are art lovers serving art lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ffZLzyr6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Pastiche","source_asin":"B07SQRBQ2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SQRBQ2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SQRBQ2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
