window.products.push({"id":888736,"name":"Keonjinn Round LED Mirror, 36 Inch Lighted Bathroom Round Mirror, Wall Mounted Black Metal Framed Frontlit Circle Vanity Mirror with Lights, Dimmable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814mZQWlE9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤Dimming & memory❤ The brightness of the round led mirror can be adjusted. Long press the round button for 3 seconds to change the light intensity from normal to brightest. When the led mirror is shut down and restarted, it will resume the last used state. ❤Design Style❤ Timeless round design with an embedded 0.6\" wide light strip combined with a 1.77\" wide aluminum frame adds a unique accent to the wall. Suitable for bathroom, bedroom, entrance hall, dining room, living room, etc. ❤Safe defogging❤ The defogging function may take 5-10 minutes to completely cover/clear the entire bathroom mirror, please turn on this function before you use it. To avoid overheating of the mirror due to long time use of defogging, defogging will automatically turn off after one hour of continuous use, then you need to click the defogging button to turn on the defogging function again. ❤Wiring support❤ The bathroom circle mirror can be connected to a plug or wall switch, and the power of the mirror can be turned on through the plug or wall switch. Note: It is currently not supported to control the brightness of the mirror through the wall dimmer switch, please use an ordinary wall switch or directly to the socket. It is recommended that the wiring be handled by a professional electrician. ❤3 year warranty❤ Full refund or free replacements for led mirrors damaged on arrival, no return needed, what you need to do is sending us some pictures via Amazon. We are constantly improving the craftsmanship and packaging of our mirrors to ensure that our mirrors reach our customers intact. Please don't hesitate to get in touch if there's anything we can help with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814mZQWlE9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keonjinn","source_asin":"B0BZPQDXY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZPQDXY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZPQDXY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
