window.products.push({"id":888783,"name":"Trivial Pursuit: 2000s Edition Game","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tbQm1RzHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Love the 2000s? Prove it with the Trivial Pursuit: 2000s Edition game. This fun game features 300 trivia cards with 1800 questions from 6 categories, including Places, Entertainment, Events, The Arts, Science and Tech, and Sports and Hobbies. With updated gameplay, this edition is not the Trivial Pursuit game from the past. Now, players can choose to answer a question or stump their opponents based on the topic at the top of each card. The first player to collect each color wedge and answer a final question wins. The Trivial Pursuit: 2000s edition game sure makes for a great game night with family and friends! Trivial Pursuit, the associated logo, the distinctive design of the game board, trivia cards, game tokens, and scoring wedges are trademarks of Hasbro.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tbQm1RzHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hasbro Gaming","source_asin":"B01ALIGY46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ALIGY46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ALIGY46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":888784,"name":"Funny Boujee Cat Throw Pillow Covers | Comfortable Linen Feeling Fabric with Vibrant CatPrint | 18 inch x 18 inch Novelty Cat Throws for Couch & Bed |","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZMQwgvEML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Boopy was founded as a way to give cat and pet lovers access to high quality and fun pet novelty items and toys. We strive to bring our customers and pet lovers premium prints on a variety of home decor items like this throw pillow cover.  We are always coming up with new innovative designs and even new products to express our love for cats, kittens and yes, even dogs. Premium Construction & Comfort *With the introduction of our cat throw pillow cover, we felt it was important to have a durable product that would not pull or wrinkle and could act as a clear canvas for our high-quality prints and designs. *Just as important, the cover has to be durable and comfortable. *Removable and Machine Washable. *Boujee cat throw pillow will fit any 18 x 18 throw pillow regardless of fill material. Many of our customers said they wanted the ability to change pillow cases based on the season or for easier cleaning and care - especially when cats cuddle up on them! *That's why we make durable high quality removable covers that can be washed or attached to new pillows whenever you want. Vibrant Printing & Colors *Our throw pillow covers look incredible. They are a functional home decor items and it is important to us that each print comes out looking like what it is supposed to. *Our design features a photorealistic style cat with brindle fur pattern design most other printers cannot reproduce correctly. The text comes out clear and crisp without blurred lines or wandering colors. Great for Gifting *Makes an awesome inexpensive gift for anyone at home *Also makes a hilarious funny gift, great for a smile! *A great office gift for any colleague, perfect for secret Santa. HAVE A LAUGH AND BUY OUR BOOPY CAT PILLOW COVER TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZMQwgvEML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boopy","source_asin":"B07P921HBJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P921HBJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P921HBJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
