window.products.push({"id":888838,"name":"PJ Wood Breakfast Table Set, Drop Leaf Table with Square Stools - Walnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yMkeYZXzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Having a bar inside your home is a special treat, but when it's a breakfast set like this one from PJ Wood, it's more than just a bar. It's a table, a bar, an island, a desk, and a counter. It's a great all-in-one set for any kitchen or dining area. It's also the ideal size for a small kitchen space where you can't house a larger dining table. Assembly is required. Setting the Bar High There's so much to appreciate about this breakfast table set. It features a drop leaf table and chairs. The counter height bar stools have you feeling like you're sitting on top of the world. The drop leaf sides extend out giving you extra space and collapse when they're not in use and two drawers provide a little needed storage. Included in This Set: Tabletop and Legs Drawers and Knobs Drop Leaves Stool Seats and Legs Tools Hardware Transitional Design This drop leaf bar table and the matching square counter height stools blend in nicely with an array of interior decorating styles. Its transitional design contains just the right amount of modern elements, including the square stools that make this set top-notch. Sturdy Construction Anytime you buy furniture, you want a manufacturer that can deliver when it comes to a quality product, and this breakfast bar table, along with each square wooden stool, does just that. Made from well-constructed, durable, and solid wood, you can rely on this set to last a long time. Maintenance Like any piece of furniture, this kitchen breakfast bar requires upkeep. It can get dusty and full of food particles and needs to be wiped down after each use. With a mild soap, and sponge, or paper towel, a little wipe down does the trick. Please avoid any abrasive cleaning tools or agents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yMkeYZXzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PJ Wood","source_asin":"B07SZF93TP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SZF93TP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SZF93TP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
