window.products.push({"id":888979,"name":"Roll Up Dish Drying Rack - Large Silicone Dish Drying Rack Over The Sink Kitchen (20.5\" x 13\") - Foldable Farmhouse Sink Drying Rack - Heavy- Duty Sta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ILfVNRcvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TAKE BACK YOUR KITCHEN – Unnecessary clutter afflicts millions of household and RV kitchens all over the world. The DI ORO Large Silicone Dish Drying Rack is a solution to this age old problem as it provides sanitary storage for your pots, pans, and dishes as they dry. Simply unroll and set the drying rack over your sink, place your dishes, and walk away with a smile as you see an uncluttered kitchen counter. UPGRADED QUALITY AND SIZE - Unlike cheap and undersized exposed stainless steel dish drying racks that suffer from rust and corrosion, the DI ORO dish drying rack has increased length (20.5”) to fit over most household sinks and a protective layer of 460°F food-grade silicone. Built-to-last and outperform the competition, you can have 100% confidence that our silicone will not scratch or damage your cookware and dishes. A MULTI-PURPOSE KITCHEN TOOL – You will quickly find a vast array of uses as you rely on your dish drying rack for daily use. The engineered strength of your dish drying rack can hold up to 30 lbs. of weight to store hot food and pans, or can act as a colander to drain washed vegetables and fruits. The opportunities for this ingenious product are limitless, and you will be delighted that you can easily roll up the dish drying rack and store it in your kitchen cabinet. EASY CLEAN-UP AND NON-SLIP TECHNOLOGY – Simply wash your dish drying rack by hand or place it in your dishwasher. Clean-up has never been easier. Our non-slip technology infused in the silicone prevents dishes from slipping and breaking on your floor, even when wet. These bonus features will give you peace of mind and more time to spend with your family. WHAT SETS US APART – Unlike other brands aiming to just sell a product to their customers, at DI ORO we aim to provide years of lasting memories and positive experiences. Our customers mean everything to us, so we have set the bar with our Forever Warranty and second to none customer service. We will replace any damaged or defective product for free or provide a full refund if you are not satisfied with your purchase; forever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ILfVNRcvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"di Oro Living","source_asin":"B08DL7P99X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-888979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DL7P99X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DL7P99X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
